  "body": "Motivated Vendor - New Plans in Place!\r\nBeautifully presented residence combining durable brick and cavity construction, privacy, and coastal views in one exceptional package. Sea views from three of the four bedrooms, with the sparkling waters of the Hauraki Gulf, Gulf Harbour Marina, and the Auckland skyline creating a stunning backdrop to everyday life.\r\nDesigned for effortless family living and entertaining, the expansive open-plan living area flows seamlessly to generous outdoor spaces. The well-appointed kitchen is a true centrepiece, featuring a gas hob, modern appliances, and ample bench space for culinary enthusiasts. Enjoy year-round entertaining with excellent indoor-outdoor flow to a covered deck, while the main living area opens to its own expansive sun-soaked decking. A gas fireplace adds warmth and ambiance during the cooler months.\r\nOutside, the fully fenced and gated grounds provide peace of mind for children and pets, while the private spa area offers the perfect retreat to relax and unwind after a busy day.\r\nLocated in sought-after Gulf Harbour, you'll enjoy easy access to local beaches, Gulf Harbour Marina, golf course, schools, and ferry services connecting you to Auckland CBD. With Penlink progressing, future connectivity and convenience continue to enhance the appeal of this exceptional location.\r\nImagine starting your day with a coffee on the deck, taking in the tranquil outlook and sea breezes, then returning home each evening to your own private sanctuary.\r\nThis is your opportunity to secure a lifestyle that perfectly balances relaxation, convenience, and coastal charm.",
